Based on official paimon-cpp v0.3.0. Add deterministic Paimon field IDs to the
physical schema generated for shredded Variant columns so Java Paimon can
convert and read the Parquet schema.

Upstream issue: https://github.com/apache/paimon-cpp/issues/344

